      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "French‑Canadian explorers named the area Terre Haute, meaning “high land,” after spotting its rise above the Wabash River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
